  - id: patient_dies
    title: THE COUGH STOPS
    body: For three days the coughing kept everyone awake. On the fourth, it stopped.
    causeLine: Mattew was sick when you took him aboard.
    conditions:
    - kind: 0
      tag: 7
      role: 5
      flag: sick
