  endings:
  - id: default
    title: THE LAST VOYAGE
    body: 'The ark leaves with what it has: enough to survive, not enough to be sure.
      Behind you, Earth is quiet. Ahead, a small green dot. It will have to do.'
    priority: 0
    minSurvival: 0
    minScience: 0
    minMorale: 0
    maxSurvival: 10
    maxScience: 10
    maxMorale: 10
    requiredFlags: []
    forbiddenFlags: []
    requiredTags: 
    forbiddenTags: 
  - id: dead_survival
    title: THE LIGHTS GO OUT
    body: The recyclers died on the fourth day. After that you counted the breaths.
      There were fewer every hour. The ark is still out there, drifting, full of
      people who no longer need anything.
    priority: 100
    minSurvival: -10
    minScience: 0
    minMorale: 0
    maxSurvival: 0
    maxScience: 10
    maxMorale: 10
    requiredFlags: []
    forbiddenFlags: []
    requiredTags: 
    forbiddenTags: 
  - id: dead_science
    title: NO ONE REMEMBERS HOW
    body: The reactor failed at 03:14. Everyone stood in the corridor, waiting for
      someone who knew what to do. Nobody did. The ark became a very expensive coffin.
    priority: 100
    minSurvival: 0
    minScience: -10
    minMorale: 0
    maxSurvival: 10
    maxScience: 0
    maxMorale: 10
    requiredFlags: []
    forbiddenFlags: []
    requiredTags: 
    forbiddenTags: 
  - id: dead_morale
    title: THE CREW STOPS LISTENING
    body: They stopped answering on the third day. By the sixth, the bridge was empty.
      The ark sails on, but there is no one left who wants to arrive.
    priority: 100
    minSurvival: 0
    minScience: 0
    minMorale: -10
    maxSurvival: 10
    maxScience: 10
    maxMorale: 0
    requiredFlags: []
    forbiddenFlags: []
    requiredTags: 
    forbiddenTags: 
  - id: eden
    title: NEW EDEN
    body: The door opens on soil that has never been farmed. Someone laughs. A child
      runs ahead before anyone can stop her. For the first time in nine days, nobody
      is counting.
    priority: 50
    minSurvival: 7
    minScience: 7
    minMorale: 7
    maxSurvival: 10
    maxScience: 10
    maxMorale: 10
    requiredFlags: []
    forbiddenFlags: []
    requiredTags: 
    forbiddenTags: 
